{"3684880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Many Ducks", "steam_appid": 3684880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/78c2cc31f3c8ebd1572425546a407801.poster.avif?t=1786728298\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/78c2cc31f3c8ebd1572425546a407801.webm?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/78c2cc31f3c8ebd1572425546a407801.mp4?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Waddleton Cove, a cozy seaside town where ducks roam freely and the annual Duck Parade is the highlight of the season. As the town’s newest Duck Rancher, you’ll build a thriving ranch, discover rare ducks, and raise a flock unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shifting forests, collect strange and wonderful ducks, customize your ranch, and prepare your favorite companions for the grand Duck Parade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Rare Ducks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/9fbd9f4b4c6d838b24dff8b4fe6347d2.poster.avif?t=1786728298\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/9fbd9f4b4c6d838b24dff8b4fe6347d2.webm?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/9fbd9f4b4c6d838b24dff8b4fe6347d2.mp4?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover wild ducks with unique appearances, personalities, traits, and songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch rare breeds and grow your flock over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden ducks, special eggs, and mysterious discoveries throughout the world</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Ranch and Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/e2ab2f033dc6edae9c6065d980303945.poster.avif?t=1786728298\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/e2ab2f033dc6edae9c6065d980303945.webm?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/e2ab2f033dc6edae9c6065d980303945.mp4?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with cozy outfits and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your ranch and upgrade coops, feeding stations, and specialized habitats to attract even more ducks</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Wilds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/a4ff9452d202b7a24d0ba5f25e8df61b.poster.avif?t=1786728298\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/a4ff9452d202b7a24d0ba5f25e8df61b.webm?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/a4ff9452d202b7a24d0ba5f25e8df61b.mp4?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through ever-changing forests with your duck companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ducks’ unique songs to recruit wild ducks</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Celebrate Duck Parade Season</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/85fec0526e59a261251307abe60a2e56.poster.avif?t=1786728298\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/85fec0526e59a261251307abe60a2e56.webm?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/85fec0526e59a261251307abe60a2e56.mp4?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft parade floats, take part in seasonal festivals, and choose your star duck to lead the annual Duck Parade</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Town of Waddleton Cove</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/7466041f935b79081ebb49802acdb2da.avif?t=1786728298\" width=568 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend quirky townsfolk, uncover special quests, and discover rare ducks through the relationships you build around town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚠️ Early Development Notice ⚠️</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Many Ducks is in its very early stages. Gameplay systems are being refined and our art direction is still evolving. Expect fresh features, visuals, and polish in upcoming updates as Waddleton Cove grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us on social media and join our Discord server to see our progress and share feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/78c2cc31f3c8ebd1572425546a407801.poster.avif?t=1786728298\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/78c2cc31f3c8ebd1572425546a407801.webm?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/78c2cc31f3c8ebd1572425546a407801.mp4?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Waddleton Cove, a cozy seaside town where ducks roam freely and the annual Duck Parade is the highlight of the season. As the town’s newest Duck Rancher, you’ll build a thriving ranch, discover rare ducks, and raise a flock unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shifting forests, collect strange and wonderful ducks, customize your ranch, and prepare your favorite companions for the grand Duck Parade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Rare Ducks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/9fbd9f4b4c6d838b24dff8b4fe6347d2.poster.avif?t=1786728298\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/9fbd9f4b4c6d838b24dff8b4fe6347d2.webm?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/9fbd9f4b4c6d838b24dff8b4fe6347d2.mp4?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover wild ducks with unique appearances, personalities, traits, and songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch rare breeds and grow your flock over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden ducks, special eggs, and mysterious discoveries throughout the world</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Ranch and Character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/e2ab2f033dc6edae9c6065d980303945.poster.avif?t=1786728298\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/e2ab2f033dc6edae9c6065d980303945.webm?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/e2ab2f033dc6edae9c6065d980303945.mp4?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with cozy outfits and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your ranch and upgrade coops, feeding stations, and specialized habitats to attract even more ducks</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Wilds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/a4ff9452d202b7a24d0ba5f25e8df61b.poster.avif?t=1786728298\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684880/extras/a4ff9452d202b7a24d0ba5f25e8df61b.webm?t=1786728298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://